.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH tine-search 1  "search " 
.SH NAME
tine\-search \- Search page names and block text, as the app\*(Aqs search does
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine search\fR [\fB\-\-pages\fR] [\fB\-\-blocks\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-g\fR|\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITEXT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search page names and block text, as the app\*(Aqs search does
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-pages\fR \fI<PAGES>\fR [default: 20]
At most this many page hits
.TP
\fB\-\-blocks\fR \fI<BLOCKS>\fR [default: 50]
At most this many block hits
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-g\fR, \fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<GRAPH>\fR
The graph. Defaults to $TINE_GRAPH, else the graph folder around the current directory
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the typed result (schema tine.cli/1) as JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITEXT\fR>

